{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const MODIFIER_KEYS: Set<string>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L40","children":[{"type":"text","value":"constants.ts:40"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set of canonical modifier key names for fast lookup."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Derived from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MODIFIER_ORDER"},{"type":"text","value":" to ensure consistency. Used to detect when\na modifier is released so we can clear non-modifier keys whose keyup events\nmay have been swallowed by the OS (e.g. macOS Cmd+key combos)."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst MODIFIER_KEYS: Set<string>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [constants.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L40)\n\nSet of canonical modifier key names for fast lookup.\n\nDerived from `MODIFIER_ORDER` to ensure consistency. Used to detect when\na modifier is released so we can clear non-modifier keys whose keyup events\nmay have been swallowed by the OS (e.g. macOS Cmd+key combos).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MODIFIER_KEYS\ntitle: MODIFIER_KEYS\n---\n\n```ts\nconst MODIFIER_KEYS: Set<string>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [constants.ts:40](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/constants.ts#L40)\n\nSet of canonical modifier key names for fast lookup.\n\nDerived from `MODIFIER_ORDER` to ensure consistency. Used to detect when\na modifier is released so we can clear non-modifier keys whose keyup events\nmay have been swallowed by the OS (e.g. macOS Cmd+key combos).\n"}
